Subject: Cantor Route Attention MCP Justification

@ [justification_uuid] a5434642-f2e6-4fc5-a62e-271c1a11fbc5
@ [canonical] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_Route_Attention_MCP.sop

& [Problem] is a verified CLI attention router without an inference-callable transport boundary

& [Decision] is a separate one-tool STDIO MCP adapter around route-only runtime execution and evidence verification

& [WhySeparate] preserves deterministic signed query_sop authority while learned route_attention remains an inspectable proposal surface

& [WhyRouteOnly] minimizes latency context output and authority while preventing hidden semantic query or llama articulation inside routing

& [Deferred] is full inference shared deliberation training procedure creation registration automation and production authority
